    "sentence_translations": [
      "Can I Buy One Day From You?",
      "",
      "Me and my classmate are good friends. Our dads are both very busy.",
      "",
      "One day, my classmate asked his dad, “Dad, how much money do you earn from working for one day?”",
      "",
      "His dad said, “1,000 yuan.”",
      "",
